    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">WS is collaborating with scientists from the Invasive Animals Cooperative Research Centre and Animal Control Technologies Australia to evaluate the Australian-made HOGGONE bait and HOGHOPPER oral delivery system for field application in the United States. The development of new tools, such as toxic HOGGONE, will allow stakeholders to more effectively manage damage and disease threats caused by invasive feral swine.</narrative>
    </description>
